{
    "chapter_num": 2,
    "verses_count": 10,
    "paragraphs_list": [
        {
            "type": "section_header",
            "text": "Ezekiel Called to Be a Prophet"
        },
        {
            "type": "section_paragraph",
            "verses_list": [
                {
                    "num_int": 1,
                    "num_str": "1",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "And He said to me, “Son of man, stand on your feet, and I will speak to you.” "
                        }
                    ]
                },
                {
                    "num_int": 2,
                    "num_str": "2",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "Then the Spirit entered me when He spoke to me, and set me on my feet; and I heard Him who spoke to me. "
                        }
                    ]
                },
                {
                    "num_int": 3,
                    "num_str": "3",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "And He said to me: “Son of man, I am sending you to the children of Israel, to a rebellious nation that has rebelled against Me; they and their fathers have transgressed against Me to this very day. "
                        }
                    ]
                },
                {
                    "num_int": 4,
                    "num_str": "4",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "For "
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "ITALIC",
                            "text": "they are"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": " "
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "FOOTNOTE",
                            "text": "Lit. stiff-faced and hard-hearted sons"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "impudent and stubborn children. I am sending you to them, and you shall say to them, ‘Thus says the Lord "
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "DIVINE_NAME",
                            "text": "God"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": ".’ "
                        }
                    ]
                },
                {
                    "num_int": 5,
                    "num_str": "5",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "As for them, whether they hear or whether they refuse—for they "
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "ITALIC",
                            "text": "are"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": " a rebellious house—yet they will know that a prophet has been among them."
                        }
                    ]
                }
            ]
        },
        {
            "type": "section_paragraph",
            "verses_list": [
                {
                    "num_int": 6,
                    "num_str": "6",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "“And you, son of man, do not be afraid of them nor be afraid of their words, though briers and thorns "
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "ITALIC",
                            "text": "are"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": " with you and you dwell among scorpions; do not be afraid of their words or dismayed by their looks, though they "
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "ITALIC",
                            "text": "are"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": " a rebellious house. "
                        }
                    ]
                },
                {
                    "num_int": 7,
                    "num_str": "7",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "You shall speak My words to them, whether they hear or whether they refuse, for they "
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "ITALIC",
                            "text": "are"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": " rebellious. "
                        }
                    ]
                },
                {
                    "num_int": 8,
                    "num_str": "8",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "But you, son of man, hear what I say to you. Do not be rebellious like that rebellious house; open your mouth and eat what I give you.”"
                        }
                    ]
                }
            ]
        },
        {
            "type": "section_paragraph",
            "verses_list": [
                {
                    "num_int": 9,
                    "num_str": "9",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "Now when I looked, there was a hand stretched out to me; and behold, a scroll of a book "
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "ITALIC",
                            "text": "was"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": " in it. "
                        }
                    ]
                },
                {
                    "num_int": 10,
                    "num_str": "10",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "Then He spread it before me; and "
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "ITALIC",
                            "text": "there was"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": " writing on the inside and on the outside, and written on it "
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "ITALIC",
                            "text": "were"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": " lamentations and mourning and woe."
                        }
                    ]
                }
            ]
        }
    ]
}